  "description": "\"After surviving a car accident that left him in a months-long coma, Lee Soo-han wakes up with no memory of his past. Standing by his side is a mysterious man who claims to be his husband—Jo Yeon-seo.\n\nAlthough they’re supposedly married, the emotional distance between them feels insurmountable. Soo-han grows wary of Yeon-seo, yet he can’t help but be drawn to the man’s steadfast devotion.\n\nJust as Soo-han begins to feel a connection, Yeon-seo shatters his expectations with a shocking revelation: he’s ready to give Soo-han a divorce—for his own good.\n\nThe more his young husband pulls away, the more genuine Soo-han’s feelings become. Determined to break through Yeon-seo’s guarded heart, Soo-han takes matters into his own hands.\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
